l) sector generates ~~2,000\\text{ Thousands}~~ jobs, which is significantly less than the Industrial sector's ~~15,000\\text{ Thousands}~~ jobs. The statement claims it generates "more employment," which is contradicted by the data.\n\nSince a factual claim within the statement is directly contradicted by the data, this statement is **Not Inferable**."
